  parchmentText: Wardoz, the King's personal wizard, has disappeared. His Majesty
    fears the wizard has been murdered or succumbed to the lures of Dread magic.
    You must find out what happened to Wardoz. You are each to be paid 100 gold coins,
    upon returning to the stairway.
