  - key: D
    trigger: 1
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: Wardoz's treasure chest contains 144 gold coins. The zombie in this
      room is dressed in wizard's robes. It is Wardoz. After destroying Wardoz, the
      first hero who searches for treasure finds the coins. They also find some papers
      on Wardoz's bench. These papers prove that Wardoz was consumed by the Dread
      magic he was experimenting with and was turned into a mindless zombie.
    requiresDeadGroup: wardoz
